{"body":{"text":["The session answered short: grounds are every utterance a statement rests on, by the one that gave its status; every session was read and drawn; nothing in the spec had changed. It wrote the types statement and topic into the wiki's types, then the elevation from draft four into the wiki beside Knowledge, as the author said, a root topic Elevation holding 325 statements under 31 topics, every ground found as an utterance, and committed it, the tests passing; it named done statements not yet carrying their commit hashes, and this session not yet kept."]},"id":"1M89XCVAWN1100R","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
